OL,3,GNEWSAActress Julie Hesmondhalgh to get
OL,4,Alifetime achievement award
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Julie Hesmondhalgh is to become
OL,7,Fthe first winner of The Theatres
OL,8,FTrust's lifetime achievement award.
OL,10,FThe former Coronation Street star from
OL,11,FAccrington, Lancashire, is being
OL,12,Frecognised for her exceptional
OL,13,Fperformances on stage and screen, as
OL,14,Fwell as her work in championing
OL,15,Fregional theatres.
OL,17,FHesmondhalgh, who played Hayley Cropper
OL,18,Ffor more than 15 years, will receive
OL,19,Fthe honour at the inaugural Great
OL,20,FBritish Theatres Awards being held in
OL,21,FLondon on 2 November.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
